sentences.text:
Injured Asharfi Lal examined as PW-1 has inter alia deposed about - (i) fracture and multiple grievous injury sustained in motor vehicle accident near Uttam Nagar Terminal at Pankha Road Signal, New Delhi on 22.07.2019 at about 8:10 am after he was hit by Honda Activa Scooty No.DL-9SBJ-5066 driven at very high speed in rash and negligent manner; (ii) treatment at ESI Hospital, Basai Darapur, New Delhi where he remained admitted from 22.07.2019 to 24.07.2019;
(iii) monthly Income Rs.25,500/- by working with Shiv Naresh Sport Pvt. Ltd.; (iv) loss of income from 22.07.2019 to 09.10.2019; (v) expenses incurred on treatment, medicines, conveyance,
attendant charges, special diet & physiotherapy AND (vi) general and special damages consequent to bodily injury sustained in road accident.

He has also relied upon following documents:
i. Treatment Record of ESI Hospital, Basai Darapur, New Delhi - Ex.PW-1/1;
Asharfi Lal vs Sandeep Yadav on 3 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/84207433/
4 ii. DAR - Ex.PW-1/2;
iii. Certificate & Pay-slips of June, July & October 2019 - Ex.PW-1/3 (Colly);
iv. Copy of Aadhar Card - Ex.PW-1/4.
8.

Following factors are to be taken into account for assessing compensation under the head - Pain and Suffering:
i. Nature of injury;
ii. Parts of body where injuries occurred; iii. Surgeries, if any;
iv. Confinement in hospital;
v. Duration of the treatment.
MACT No.883/2019
